  "system": {
    "slug": "destiny-ascension",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 21
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Sovereign is a Reaper: a two-kilometre sentient warship of a machine race that wipes out advanced organic life every fifty thousand years. Left behind to open the Citadel relay and bring the rest of its kind out of dark space, it posed as Saren's flagship and used indoctrination to bend him and Matriarch Benezia to its will. At the Battle of the Citadel it outclassed every ship in the Council fleet, until Saren's death broke its barriers and the Alliance fleet broke its hull.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier Array:</strong> 1,000 Shield Points, regenerating 200 per round.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publication": {
        "title": "Mass Effect Compendium",
        "authors": "nscarpinatodev",
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": true
      },
      "languages": {
        "value": [],
        "details": ""
      },
      "blurb": "The Reaper that led the geth against the Citadel, disguised as Saren's flagship."
