      "system": {
        "slug": null,
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Indoctrination</strong></p><hr /><p>1 mile. Sovereign's presence reshapes the minds around it. A creature that spends 8 hours in the aura or aboard Sovereign must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:44] save or gain a point of indoctrination (GM tracked). At 3 points it obeys Sovereign's will while believing it acts freely. A creature with the reaper trait, or one that is already indoctrinated, is unaffected.</p>",
          "gm": ""
