      "system": {
        "slug": null,
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Avatar</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span></p><hr /><p>Sovereign takes direct control of an indoctrinated creature anywhere in the galaxy, as Saren became its avatar on the Citadel. While it controls an avatar, the avatar has resistance 10 to all damage and Sovereign's Kinetic Barrier Array is linked to it. If the avatar is destroyed while Sovereign controls it, the feedback drops Sovereign's barriers to 0 Shield Points and Sovereign is stunned 3.</p>",
